ion resolve the running [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]member's name rather than the stale lane/family name held in the process[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]environment, so footer links and publication requests both name a real [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]run.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make hood publication tolerate container-named requests[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]publish[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]publish: resolve an outbox request that names a pure family/clan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]container to a concrete run in that hood so publication succeeds instead[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of raising \"absent from project inventory\" and quarantining.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Self-healing agents sidecar transactions[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sidecar_tx[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar_tx: guarantee a clean sidecar working tree before every rebase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pull, clear stale index locks, and revert uncommitted payload writes on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every early-return and exception path so one failed publish cannot wedge[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]all later ones.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Surface quarantined and stalled publications[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visibility[dim] · [dim][/dim]after publish, sidecar_tx[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visibility: add a doctor check and stronger reporting for the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]publication outbox so quarantined or long-stalled requests are noticed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of accumulating unseen for days.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Recover the backlog and verify end to end[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]backfill[dim] · [dim][/dim]after identity, publish, sidecar_tx[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]backfill: drain the existing outbox, re-publish the hoods that were [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]never written, and report which historical commit links remain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]permanently dead.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ad","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ad.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-15440f0ba2fc650a4570353315ffb879","started_at":"2026-07-28T07:44:40.215434","state":"dismissed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":"2026-07-28T08:43:20.779887","files":{"chat":{"digest":"79e9a2cab1af621600ec4deacec1fe82f843b5ae01ea11290a34b8b7ba49fc5d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ad.5/chat.md","size_bytes":3962},"commits":{"digest":"0fdbd1ca4d2b0be4b254173ce4ea7d14645c46c32154cae22835423c4c8d44ad","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ad.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"5b3d25fe6a128258e2b7e1e7b278010a9b777f1aa113b70f0b336fe2bd180bb8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ad.5/meta.json","size_bytes":554},"state":{"digest":"d09d5e153c75732e1d296f6299dc88e4e3afcaebb5449a5ca0815ea968606eff","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ad.5/state.json","size_bytes":225}},"finished_at":"2026-07-28T08:43:20.779887","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-ad.5","local_name":"sase-ad.5","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-ad","agent_clan_generation":"20260728074427","approve":true,"cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ad","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-ad.5","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-206a1a6244d3